{"id":"a9b252ec785318ff","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-iteration-support.md","title":"ZFC Iteration Support","display":"df-zfc-iteration-support — ZFC Iteration Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-iteration-support","aliases":["58-df-zfc-iteration-support"],"display":"df-zfc-iteration-support — ZFC Iteration Support","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-iteration-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-iteration-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-iteration-support — ZFC Iteration Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,S,Q,e,\\delta,U,W\\in V\">\\(p,S,Q,e,\\delta,U,W\\in V\\)</span> (condition, support, iterand family, unit selector, length, condition carrier, and iterand-code carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}support} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S(S,p,Q,e,\\delta;U,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,W)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(e,W,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\delta,U)\\land\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\delta\\mid p(\\alpha)\\neq e(Q(\\alpha))\\}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}support} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S(S,p,Q,e,\\delta;U,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,W)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(e,W,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\delta,U)\\land\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\delta\\mid p(\\alpha)\\neq e(Q(\\alpha))\\}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 分别给出迭代项代码和条件的集合载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 显式选择每个迭代项的单位条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,S,Q,e,\\delta,U,W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}support} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IterationSupport}_S(S,p,Q,e,\\delta;U,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,W)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(e,W,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\delta,U)\\land\nS=\\{\\alpha\\in\\delta\\mid p(\\alpha)\\neq e(Q(\\alpha))\\}\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-iteration-support.md|58-df-zfc-iteration-support]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6